# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## New: Who is…?
- *"Who is MrNox?"* shows what the server knows about a player: online now or last seen, play time, deaths, mobs defeated and since when Merl knows them, with a link to their skin
- Part of the name works (*"who is Nox"*), and *"who is the player Notch"* looks up anyone
- Questions about bosses and other wiki things (*"who is Arachne"*) still get the wiki

## New: Build ideas
- *"What should I build next?"* or *"any idea for a new structure?"* gets one of over 1,200 build ideas

## New: Tips about anything
- *"Tip about creepers"* gets a tip about creepers, *"tip about Ron"* or *"tip about me"* a friendly pro tip

## Block palettes
- Palettes now have nine blocks instead of six

## Merl understands more
- *"How many structures are there…"* and other list questions get the overview page (like *"Ambient Structures Overview"*)
- Short forms of our packs: KS, EE, WW, NMV, NNT, NKI, NAT and ARR
- Misspelled question words (*"wher"*, *"wat"*) no longer turn into strange corrections
- *"Another tip? I don't get that one"* gives another tip, even with a comment after it
- Jokes about short names (*"Ron"*) no longer pick jokes that only contain those letters
- Unfinished wiki pages no longer show *"Your content here"*
- *"Where do I find Tenku?"* gets Tenku's page, not the Tenku setting
